{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名句味也是智慧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。善相句義。得意趣也。對除無失。向大乘故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。喜極曰悲。自鼻曰涕。自目曰淚。含啼曰泣。舍利不聞說法經懽喜勇躍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者從"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。是希有\n也。從甚深智之所發故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。未聞而聞。成希有也。聞思修惠。俱名惠眼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信心清淨之所生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。有巧方便。顯示眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。現前無佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。謂有持戒及修福也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。展轉傳聞也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。信文解義。得\n\n念總持也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。斷後為難也。於難信解處時難信解故。故名希有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。想不現也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。眾所謂也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。欲斷所疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。事證也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。世流布語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。離報著言。照見五蘊皆空。一一無我"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。不見嗔怒害我者。相故。言無眾生無壽者相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。刖足截手。各於節節。分四支故"}
